### TITLE ###
DeleteRemovesForwardBackspaceRemovesBehind
### DESCRIPTION ###
Both are intrinsic edits. Delete needs its own key because a REPL cursor spends
much of its life mid-line, where backspace alone is not enough.
### PROMPT ###
>
### KEYS ###
"abcd"
left
left
delete
backspace
enter
### VALUE ###
ad
### OUTCOME ###
submitted
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
>‸
--- frame 1 (a) ---
>a‸
--- frame 2 (b) ---
>ab‸
--- frame 3 (c) ---
>abc‸
--- frame 4 (d) ---
>abcd‸
--- frame 5 (left) ---
>abc‸d
--- frame 6 (left) ---
>ab‸cd
--- frame 7 (delete) ---
>ab‸d
--- frame 8 (backspace) ---
>a‸d
--- frame 9 (enter) ---
>ad
